Sen. Juan Miguel “Migz” F. Zubiri: Thank you very much, presiding officer. Yung akin lang kasi, yung binangit ko kanina, how do we, there was a ruling already before the Supreme Court that says, Unexplained wealth is considered ill-gotten wealth. But how do you determine unexplained wealth? The best way to determine unexplained wealth is really findings from the BIR. If you paid the proper taxes. Kasi you can always say naman ninyo, Salen, nagkamali ako, hindi ko na-declare yung income ko. Pero that was, how do you say, legally acquired. Especially if you pay, the final acknowledgement of that is the payment to the BIR. Kung sa akin lang personal, napakalaga na pinakita na po yung mga pera sa bangko, yung cash flow. Atin yung tatanong na yan po sa BIR kung sapat po ang binayaran po nila mga buis. Ayan ba ay tamang transaksyon. You can only find that out. Through the BIR. Kaya napakalaga before putting the cart before the horse is really to end this, how do you say, forensics gathering by the prosecution is the BIR. Then after which, whatever financial analyst they want to present is fine. Pero as far as I'm concerned, so that we don't break the chain of thought. The chain of thought that we've had the last few days. The BIR will tie it all together, Your Honor, Mr. President. So I agree with Senator Sotto. Kung pwede, break na muna tayo ngayon. Baka namang kaya sa biogesic yung kanilang abogado. Dalawang biogesic lang na 500. Ayos na. And he can present the witness this afternoon. But what is important is... Ay talaga ilabas din yung BIR muna bago yung conclusion dito sa financial expert. I presume the financial expert will come up with a conclusion or a picture on how this all, put it all together, how it will all end. So yun lamang po, Mr. President. So I support the motion or the request or appeal of the good Senator Sotto.

106
00:42:12,630 --> 00:42:22,060
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Senator Judge Erwin Tulfo, what is your pleasure? And then the chair will... Make the corresponding order and the reaction to the bill.

107
00:42:22,160 --> 00:43:27,150
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Before you make your ruling, Mr. Presiding Officer, on the request of Senator Tito Sotto, manifestation, I'd just like to ask, tama naman po ang sinasabi ng defense na napakadami ang mga prosecutors po dito. na hindi ba po pwede or get absent yung isa, hindi na po pwede yung iba. Eh lahat naman ito nakikita ko mga magagaling ho ito eh. Tingin ko mga de campanilla itong mga abogado natin sa prosecution. And I think they can handle the job. So ang isa pa may mga kasamahanong tayo dito nagtatanong bakit di ba kaya ng iba na abogado. Mabuti sana ho kung... Ika nga operasyon ito, buhay ng tao na pag operahan mo sa puso ay cardiologist na kailangan mo. Hindi naman siguro dito because there are lawyers in there. They studied, they went to law school. So I believe some of these lawyers can handle that, Mr. Presiding Officer. Pangalawa, kung ganun, isa po naisip namin baka lagi humagamit itong...

108
00:43:28,950 --> 00:43:43,210
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Ika nga suspindihin natin dahil hindi sila ready ang kung sino mang kampo ho yan, baka maging president po ito. Na pag absent ho yung abogado, eh magsususpindi tayo. Kailan ho tayo matatapos, Mr. Presiding Officer?

109
00:43:44,180 --> 00:43:46,520
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Thank you. Senator Judge Pangilinan is recognized.

