115
00:45:54,710 --> 00:46:20,080
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: If Attorney Erwin is not available and you do not wish to present the witness using another counsel, then we will call it, as I said, wag nyo akong hamunin, an early day for today. And we will hopefully be able to present the BIR witness tomorrow with or without Attorney Erwin as the first witness thereafter Attorney Cabrera and

116
00:46:22,630 --> 00:46:31,390
