00:46:52,110 --> 00:46:52,750
Atty. Sheila C. Sison: Thank you, Sir.

122
00:46:53,710 --> 00:47:04,490
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Again, we pause for early lunch. Enjoy lunch. And we shall see each other at 2.30 slash 3 p.m. this afternoon. Trial is in recess.

