139
05:09:19,010 --> 05:09:27,470
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: We did not make statements or comments earlier because it was addressed to the honorable court but we will make a statement today.

140
05:09:30,390 --> 05:10:07,800
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: Your Honor, wala akong humihingi na mag-adjust po yung depensa. Katulad po kanina ay pinaubaya po namin ang bagay na ito sa kagalang-galang na hukumang ito. At kung paano po nila tatanggapin at pagpapasyahan po ang pakiusap ng prosecution. Nagkaroon po ng paunang pasya. Nagkaroon din po ng panibagong pasya at tumalima po kami sa lahat po ng mga naging pagpapasyah. Kaya naman po sinikap namin na paharapin ang aming handling counsel kahit meron pa rin siyang kaunting sakit hanggang ngayon. For the record, Your Honor.

141
05:10:08,160 --> 05:10:32,000
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Again, without anything being further said on the matter, the chair, relying on the candor of the counsels for the prosecution as well as the other party as officers of the court, will rely on the word spoken earlier this morning. Without further discussion on the matter, so that we can proceed and hopefully make use of this afternoon. Would you like to turn it over to Attorney Erwin?

142
05:10:32,220 --> 05:10:33,280
Rep. Terry L. Ridon: Yes, Your Honor. Thank you.

143
05:10:34,800 --> 05:10:38,000
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney Erwin, can you call your... Witness?

