147
05:11:09,820 --> 05:11:24,460
Atty. Renato N. Bantug Jr.: Ma'am, kindly raise your right hand. You, Anne Loraine Garcia-Marquez, do swear that the evidence you shall give in the case now pending between the Philippines and Vice President Sara Zimmerman Duterte shall be the truth, the whole truth, and nothing but the truth. So help you God.

148
05:11:25,060 --> 05:11:25,600
Atty. Anne Loraine Garcia-Marquez: Yes, I do.

