150
05:11:31,360 --> 05:11:32,300
Atty. Anne Loraine Garcia-Marquez: Anne po, Your Honor.

151
05:11:32,860 --> 05:11:39,000
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Attorney Anne, naunawaan niyo po ba inyong pinanumpaan kaugnay sa pagbibigay niyo ng inyong testimonya sa harap na hukumang ito?

152
05:11:39,540 --> 05:11:40,420
Atty. Anne Loraine Garcia-Marquez: Yes po, Your Honor.

153
05:11:42,680 --> 05:11:52,380
Sen. Francis "Chiz" G. Escudero: Your witness, oh, prior to that, kindly make your offer, Attorney Erwin, and if you need a break, should it be necessary, just kindly let the court know.

154
