787
06:57:54,340 --> 06:57:58,760
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Certificate authorizing registration para sa shares ng Cali88 Foods Corporation.

788
06:58:03,460 --> 06:58:50,890
Atty. Anne Loraine Garcia-Marquez: Based po sa certification issued by the Bureau of Internal Revenue, this is to certify that based on the Bureau of Internal Revenue database, no records arising from or in connection with any transfer, sale, disposition, or other conveyance of shares of stock of Cali88 Foods Corporation owned by Manases R. Carpio. In relation thereto, no documents or records were found evidencing the payment, assessment, or settlement of any applicable taxes, fees, or other charges arising from or in connection with such transfer or disposition. This certification is issued in compliance with the subpoena duces tecum, case number 004-2026, issued by the Senate Presiding Officer, Hon. Francis Chiz G. Escudero, on October 1, 2026.

789
06:58:54,540 --> 06:59:01,860
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Para sa mga hindi nakakaalam, pakipaliwanag ano ba ang Electronic Certificate Authorizing Registration o eCAR?

790
06:59:03,360 --> 06:59:19,920
Atty. Anne Loraine Garcia-Marquez: Ang eCAR po or Electronic Certificate Authorizing Registration na isang document na ini-issue ng BIR na nag-certify na ito po ay ang lahat ng mga taxes relating to the transfer of any property are paid po.

791
06:59:20,800 --> 06:59:30,960
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: At ano naman ang papel nito o kahalagahan? Pagdating sa paglipat o pag-transfer ng shares of stock sa corporate records o books?

792
06:59:36,290 --> 07:00:29,420
Atty. Anne Loraine Garcia-Marquez: Meron po kaming revenue issuance na nagsasabi na in case of any transfer or disposition ng kahit anong shares of stock that are not traded in stock exchange, there's a necessity to secure, dapat kumuha ng ECAR from the Bureau of Internal Revenue. At bago rin po itong transfer na ito, Ito ay ma-record sa books ng isang corporation, then kailangan pong bayad lahat po ng mga taxes. So the secretary of the corporation has the duty to check whether or not may na-file na eCAR or to record it. And pag hindi bayad ang taxes, such secretary or kung sino man yung agent dun sa stock transfer books nila, should report the same to the Bureau of Internal Revenue.

793
07:00:29,980 --> 07:00:35,640
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: At ano ang effect kung walang eCAR? Ano ang effect sa transfer ng shares of stock?

794
07:00:36,390 --> 07:00:46,660
Atty. Anne Loraine Garcia-Marquez: Based po sa revenue issuance po namin, dapat po ay hindi po siya na-record dun sa books ng company kapag walang eCAR.

795
07:00:47,020 --> 07:00:52,180
Atty. Erwin G. Matib: Okay, so kailangan ng eCAR bago ma-record yung pagbenta ng shares sa corporate records.

796
07:00:53,390 --> 07:00:56,630
Atty. Anne Loraine Garcia-Marquez: Yes po, based po sa revenue issuance po namin. Okay,

797
07:00:56,690 --> 07:01:19,540
