816
07:03:10,260 --> 07:03:20,180
Atty. Anne Loraine Garcia-Marquez: Yes po, based po sa rules namin, yung secretary of the corporation has the duty to inform the Bureau of Internal Revenue pag hindi po bayad yung taxes dun sa transfer po.

